%description:
An Unstructured PDU session has one QoS flow, on the default bearer: a second bearer
defined for the UE is an error when the base station installs the UE's bearers.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

*.ue[*].sessionType = "Unstructured"
*.ue[*].hasIpv4 = false
*.ue[*].numUnstructuredApps = 1
*.ue[*].unstructuredApp[0].source.packetLength = 100B
*.ue[*].unstructuredApp[0].source.productionInterval = 20ms
*.ue[*].unstructuredApp[0].source.initialProductionOffset = 0.1s
*.upf.nodeControl.unstructuredPrefix = "10.99.0.0/16"
*.upf.nodeControl.unstructuredServer = "server"
*.upf.nodeControl.unstructuredServerPort = 5000
*.upf.nodeControl.unstructuredPort = 5001
*.bearerConfigurator.staticDrbs = [
    {coreNetwork: "5gc", ue: "ue[*]", drbId: 1, isDefault: true, suppressSdapHeader: true, lcg: 3, rlcMode: "UM"},
    {coreNetwork: "5gc", ue: "ue[*]", drbId: 2, mappedQfis: [1], lcg: 1, rlcMode: "UM"}
    ]

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
ConnectionControlEnb: NrSessionTestNetwork.ue[0] has an Unstructured session, which has one QoS flow on the default bearer, but DRB 2 of its bearer definitions is another one
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
